 ## How it works
-The fine-tuning process varies depending on the initialization source and the target application (e.g., novel view synthesis, style transfer, or volume visualization). However, the core mechanism involves initializing a set of 3D Gaussians $\mathcal{G}$ and optimizing their parameters using gradient descent on a rendering loss.
